Package: ToolsRTM.app
Type: Package
Title: Interactive Shiny Applications for ToolsRTM and SCOPEinR
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Carlos",
           family = "Camino",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "carlos.caminogonzalez@wur.nl",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5188-4406"))
Maintainer: Carlos Camino <carlos.caminogonzalez@wur.nl>
Description: Companion package to 'ToolsRTM' shipping get.simulator(), a
    launcher for the suite's interactive Shiny apps (PROSAIL, PROSAIL-BRDF,
    MARMIT, SPART, SCOPE, LUTs, RTMs, STAC, Inversion). Split out from the
    core 'ToolsRTM' package (which stays free of Shiny/UI dependencies) so
    users who only need the modelling functions in scripts are not forced
    to install this package's much larger dependency set. GitLab-only:
    not intended for CRAN submission (the interactive-app dependency set
    and bundled MARMIT reference databases make it too heavy, and several
    apps depend on 'SCOPEinR', itself not CRAN-bound).
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports: ToolsRTM, shiny, shinythemes
